==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|из-}} + {{der|ru|orv|мѣнити}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*měniti}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|измени́ть}}
** {{audio|ru|Ru-изменить.ogg}}
* {{IPA|ru|[izmʲæˈnʲitʲ]|~|[izmʲaˈnʲitʲ]|a=Southern Russia}} (''phonetic respelling'': измянить)
* {{IPA|ru|[jizmʲiˈnʲit͡sʲ]|a=Belarus}} (''phonetic respelling'': йизмениць)
* {{IPA|ru|[izmʲiˈnʲitʲ]|a=Ukraine}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|измени́ть|pf|impf=изменя́ть}}

# to [[change]], to [[alter]], to [[modify]], to [[edit]]
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1887|author=s:ru:Антон Чехов<t:{{w|Anton Chekhov}}>|title=s:ru:[[Отец (Чехов)|Отец]]|chapter=|location=Санкт-Петербург|publisher=w:ru:Петербургская газета|newversion=English translation from|translator2=w:en:Constance Garnett|title2=s:en:[[The Chorus Girl and Other Stories/A Father|A Father]]|location2=|publisher2=|year2=1920|page2=|pageurl2=
|text=Когда́ немно́го погодя́ принесли́ пи́во, стари́к при ви́де буты́лок оживи́лся и ре́зко '''измени́л''' свой тон.|t=When a little later the beer was brought in, the old man seemed to revive at the sight of the bottles and abruptly '''changed''' his tone.}}
# to [[vary]]
# to [[betray]], to become [[unfaithful]], to [[cheat on]] {{+obj|ru|dat}}
# to [[break]], to [[violate]] ''(an oath, promise)''
# to [[fail]] ''(memory)''
# to [[desert]]

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4c(7)|измени́ть}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|изме́на}}
* {{l|ru|измене́ние}}
* {{l|ru|измени́ться}}, {{l|ru|изменя́ться}} ''(intransitive)''
* {{l|ru|меня́ть}}
